  <name>Pikaball</name>
  <summary>Pikachu Volleyball - Revamped Murcia LAN Party Edition</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A modern C++ reimplementation of the classic Pikachu Volleyball game (1997) using SDL3,
      with the custom sprites of the Murcia LAN Party 2009 special edition.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Classic Pikachu Volleyball gameplay</li>
      <li>Single-player mode against the computer, or two players on the same keyboard</li>
      <li>Original sound effects and music</li>
      <li>Options menu to change the game speed, winning score and music</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.butakus.pikaball.desktop</launchable>
